                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0955e1e-9e49-448a-b96f-0a5c10f97205",
                                "sense_id": "abe9fa32-83d5-3cbc-b768-0dd5defe6aba",
                                "text": "Набо́рщики не разошли́сь домо́й, а ходи́ли ста́ями, сбива́лись ку́чами и чита́ли телегра́ммы, кото́рые шли тепе́рь всю ночь напролё́т, че́рез ка́ждые че́тверть ча́са, становя́сь всё чудо́вищнее и страшне́е.",
                                "translation": "Instead of going home, the compositors clustered together reading the telegrams that were now arriving in a steady stream, every fifteen minutes or so, each more eerie and disturbing than the one before.",
                                "english": "Instead of going home, the compositors clustered together reading the telegrams that were now arriving in a steady stream, every fifteen minutes or so, each more eerie and disturbing than the one before."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
